G — влагостойкий, не боится воды и солнца 💧☀️; PLA — для декора. Объясню, что лучше под вашу задачу 🤝\n\nКак заказать:\n1️⃣ Напишите в сообщения группы — что нужно\n2️⃣ Пришлю фото похожих работ и сразу обсудим цену\n3️⃣ Печать 1–3 дня ⏳, забираете самовывозом в Волхове или отправляю Авито-доставкой 📦\n\n📍 Волхов","latestPost":null,"source":"Рост ID · кандидат, создание не подтверждено","wallUnavailable":false,"verifiedAt":1793667589359,"verification":"groups.getById","firstSeen":1793526258946,"status":"new","available":true,"observation":{"verdict":"frontier_other_day","appearance":{"kind":"frontier_candidate","method":"frontier_transition","from":1793523931411,"to":1793526258946,"lowerId":242820094,"previousResponse":"placeholder","priorChecks":1},"checks":1,"firstChecked":1793526258475,"lastChecked":1793526258946,"missingChecks":0,"oldestObservedPost":null,"wallCheckedAt":1793667589991,"wallError":null,"events":[{"kind":"returned","at":1793526258946},{"kind":"frontier_transition","at":1793526258946}]},"collectorFeed":true},{"id":242820735,"name":"Академия Экспертного бизнеса","screenName":"club242820735","city":"Москва","category":"Education","members":1,"posts":0,"avatar":false,"photo":"https://sun1-87.userapi.com/impg/9FmuZgmL8ElIl3ap2VNqqvCJuR3XBTRcL5RstQ/IkJdt6c43WI.jpg?quality=96&as=32x32,48x48,72x72,108x108,160x160,240x240,360x360&sign=80af15cf714eb8b0c9b0fb180d3fb037&u=2YEVTlkKBuNPY0mjMeXr7QUGKVqyKPrs2k12FX4q3nE&cs=200x200","cover":false,"coverUrl":"","canMessage":null,"description":"","latestPost":null,"source":"Рост ID · кандидат, создание не подтверждено","wallUnavailable":false,"verifiedAt":1793667589991,"verification":"groups.getById","firstSeen":1793526258946,"status":"new","available":true,"observation":{"verdict":"frontier_other_day","appearance":{"kind":"frontier_candidate","method":"frontier_transition","from":1793523931411,"to":1793526258946,"lowerId":242820094,"previousResponse":"placeholder","priorChecks":1},"checks":1,"firstChecked":179352625